    "body": "Settings now have ordered User, Developer, and Lexer lanes. Lexer Mode requires the active Lexer-Lux GitHub account, adds a distinct packaged-default control beside every setting, and supports double-clicking the name or description to copy the current value as the default. Shared dependency controls now remember values they turned off, restore them when the requirement returns, and show flowing arrows on hover. The manual now defines these scopes and behaviors.",
